[00:00.000]...
[00:24.831]An adorable star
{"一颗可爱的星辰"}
[00:27.738]we can see from afar
{"我们远远就能望见"}
[00:30.787]But a truth it belies
{"但它掩盖着真相"}
[00:33.863]All who enters her dies
{"踏入者皆会消亡"}
[00:36.877]Hear the beating of wings
{"听那羽翼的拍打声"}
[00:39.905]as the pendulum swings
{"随着钟摆摇晃"}
[00:42.966]And we can't believe
{"我们难以置信"}
[00:44.679]it's ever gonna end
{"这竟会迎来终章"}
[00:48.718]You know blood is
{"你深知血缘"}
[00:50.513]thicker than water
{"比水更浓稠"}
[00:54.550]But you just want everyone
{"但你只期盼众人"}
[00:58.181]to get along
{"能和睦共处"}
[01:03.535]For the candles in the darkness
{"为黑暗中的烛火"}
[01:07.304]Burning up the sorrow
{"燃尽所有哀愁"}
[01:10.354]There's no end to sadness
{"悲伤永无止境"}
[01:13.328]We didn't learn
{"我们从未领悟"}
[01:15.677]For the broken hearted people
{"为心碎的人们"}
[01:19.464]Diamonds now surround us
{"钻石此刻环绕四周"}
[01:22.056]So out of our mind
{"如此疯狂失神"}
[01:24.746]Leave the past behind
{"将过往抛在身后"}
[01:28.530]We're a binary heart
{"我们是双生心脏"}
[01:31.559]Tear each other apart
{"将彼此撕扯破碎"}
[01:34.623]Growing from the same stem
{"同根而生"}
[01:37.672]They were us. We were them
{"他们即我们 我们即他们"}
[01:40.704]On a course to collide
{"注定相撞的命运"}
[01:43.687]Is it strength not to hide?
{"不隐藏是否就是力量？"}
[01:46.771]Let the politics
{"让政治博弈"}
[01:48.537]decide you're not a friend
{"判定你并非盟友"}
[01:52.489]You know blood is
{"你深知血缘"}
[01:54.377]thicker than water
{"浓于水"}
[01:58.340]But you just want everyone
{"但你只希望众人"}
[02:02.020]to get along
{"和睦相处"}
[02:07.282]For the candles in the darkness
{"为黑暗中的烛火"}
[02:11.105]Burning up the sorrow
{"燃尽悲伤"}
[02:14.168]There's no end to sadness
{"哀伤永无止境"}
[02:17.179]We didn't learn
{"我们未曾领悟"}
[02:19.444]For the broken hearted people
{"为心碎的人们"}
[02:23.315]Diamonds now surround us
{"钻石此刻环绕我们"}
[02:25.915]So out of our mind
{"如此疯狂"}
[02:28.577]Leave the past behind
{"将过往抛却"}
[02:32.774]Binary
{"二进制"}
[02:36.899]A centrifugal force
{"离心力"}
[02:39.623]Pushing us far away
{"将我们推向远方"}
[02:42.948]That's our eternity
{"那便是我们的永恒"}
[02:44.902]Binary
{"二进制"}
[02:49.021]We can't escape the force
{"我们无法挣脱这力量"}
[02:51.727]Crushing us.
{"将我们碾碎"}
[02:53.278]Gravity is our eternity
{"引力即永恒"}
